title: Left-wing Split
new-page: true 
subtitle: The Left's disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: left_dissent >= 60
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_split = 1; 

if (Q.left_strength < 10) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 3; 
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 3; 
    Q.commons_collectivist += 3; 
    Q.rb_strength -= 300; 
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.04; 
} else if (Q.left_strength < 25) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 4; 
    Q.commons_collectivist += 4; 
    Q.disfavored_collectivist += 2;
    Q.rb_strength -= 350; 
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.05; 
} else if (Q.left_strength < 40) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 5; 
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 5; 
    Q.commons_collectivist += 5; 
    Q.disfavored_collectivist += 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 400; 
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.06; 
} else if (Q.left_strength < 60) {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 6; 
    Q.commons_collectivist += 6; 
    Q.disfavored_collectivist += 3;
    Q.rb_strength -= 500; 
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.08; 
} else {
    Q.commons_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.disfavored_marcher -= 8; 
    Q.commons_collectivist += 8; 
    Q.disfavored_collectivist += 4;
    Q.rb_strength -= 600; 
    if (Q.rb_militancy >= 0.1) Q.rb_militancy -= 0.1; 
}

Q.collectivist_r += 1; 
Q.marcher_r -= 1; 

Q.left_strength = Q.left_strength / 2; 

Q.unionist_relation += 5; 
Q.ddp_relation += 5; 
Q.gold_relation += 5; 
Q.lvp_relation += 5; 
Q.ddp_left += 2; 
Q.gold_left += 1; 
Q.lvp_left += 1; 

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors; 
if (Q.levi_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.levi_advisor = 0; 
Q.collectivist_relation -= 8; 

if (Q.seydewitz_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.seydewitz_advisor = 0; 
if (Q.rosenfeld_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.rosenfeld_advisor = 0; 
if (Q.siemsen_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1; 
Q.siemsen_advisor = 0; 
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
go-to: sapd_formed if centrists_resign = 1 and not sapd_formed
max-visits: 1

= Left-wing members split

Our policy choices have greatly offended the left, and many of their leaders have split to form a new party, the <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>, or <span style="color: #9B0000;">Socialist Worker's Party</span>. They do not count a huge section of our membership, so this should be survivable.

[? if centrists_resign = 1 : Many former <span style="color: #c00000;">Centrist Marxists</span> have joined with the <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span>, the party formed by dissident leftists. They have brought their support base and organization skills to the party, leading to its growth as a nascent rival to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> for the support of the working class. ?]

